{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e0f9d6006945d27fdd13","chatId":"ce7bf1eb21774f9c84936e818505db86","sessionId":null,"userId":53347,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[C]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[C]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":845,"promptTokens":1534,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:57"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006691861635172942,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0f9d6006945d27fdd12","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367737453,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:57","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e0f9d6006945d27fdd12","chatId":"ce7bf1eb21774f9c84936e818505db86","sessionId":null,"userId":53347,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n孙悦是学校话剧社的负责人，她筹划了一场重要的校园剧场演出。在排练期间，李明在不了解道具的价值和脆弱性的情况下随意使用它们，并不知道自己无意中损坏了道具。张涛，另一名剧社成员，明知道李明的行为，但因为他对孙悦一直有意见，决定不告诉她。当孙悦询问剧社成员道具的损坏情况时，李明意识到了自己的错误。\n\n[问题]\n李明在意识到自己无意中损坏了珍贵道具后，他会感到什么样的情绪？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 李明可能感到满意，因为他并不认为那些道具有多重要。\nB. 李明可能感到无动于衷，因为他不理解道具的价值。\nC. 李明可能会感到惊慌和内疚，因为他无意中破坏了重要的剧社财产。\nD. 李明可能感到困惑，因为他不确定自己是否真的损坏了道具。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006691861635172942,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0f9d6006945d27fdd13","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367737451,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:57","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c646a4f0b03843ecb5cc851ad69fc1ce"}